id: as-03-fists-and-feathers
number: 403
name: Fists and Feathers
description: A brings two Vanguards, B brings two Archers. Nothing on the field can stand in front of anyone, and every Grappler on the board wants an Archer.
design: Asymmetry 3 — duplicate classes on both sides. Two Vanguards versus two Archers.
design: No Wardbearer anywhere, so nobody can Guard Stance in front of an Archer. No Threadcaster, so nothing pulls.
retired: Near-identical board and enemy mix to `as-09-glass`, which states the same thesis harder.

spawn h = Husk
spawn g = Grappler
spawn s = Stalker

roster a: Vanguard, Vanguard
roster b: Archer, Archer

board:
  ..g..BB
  .O.^.BB
  .H....O
  .......
  O....H.
  A..^..s
  AAh.s.h
